  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:62pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-48pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;      2. 「－」は、当該銘柄を保有していないことを示しています。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
